	     "the authored line. A_TURN_BACK's own !K_UP row hands A_DRAP" \
	     "(268), A_DRAP's K_DOWN row starts the look-down at the foot" \
	     "(269), and its row 5 WAIT !K_DOWN clause parks the state on" \
